+ * "Constructed Firmware Version" 0x0264, 61520 bytes in one SPI burst. Rows and columns are the A4 iPod's;
+ * the surface is the 4-inch panel's (640x1136 at 326 ppi, 49.9 x 88.6 mm), and the frame the N81's
+ * scaled to 1136 lines, not measured.
